    "solution": "Pick up the lantern from the loaded western recoil plate and jump with its return onto the upper outbound gallery. Carry shade and glide east to the conveyor. Put the lantern onto the belt: it passes the one-tile vent and presses the remote plate. Drop beneath the masonry and take its now-open underpass. Climb to the receiving shelf and reclaim the same lantern. Load the eastern recoil plate while carrying it, jump with its return to the tally balcony, then climb the steps and carry shade west across the upper return walk to the starting-side gate.",
